            "date": "2020-08-25T19:51:47Z"
          },
          "message": "In case we fail to read the compressed content from the cache, treat the failure as a forced recache. This prevents us from failing build jobs unconditionally if cache entries are corrupt (or in case of other sporadic failures), in which case we should continue on with force-recompiling and recaching. (#836)",
