            "sha": "c922d83d42769ca787d651f81e90cbe0eeea2bee",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/sccache/git/trees/c922d83d42769ca787d651f81e90cbe0eeea2bee"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/sccache/git/commits/030c80a15e0b1aba0e61df264b320a21bb21fb15",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
            "verified": true,
            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJfRWvTCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAACxLjlLL6L1c7HyJnmK5lD/\nzcn0js+f5PeYZwJuBNugQ/H87w/jFTQhcBIHQ9lKgrSxQUh4fxHIKNEKBOaV/6oi\nSwhM779cNmkzfSmao+XjxQtI0tDz0qur+ji/UleeC020OrJoaIVMGgM4edMFBInN\nv2Sli3K4fz/gfc6om/+gAOydJuwYlvJXrkAaQlp700JZWt2Ovo2J7sfwRavU84tl\nlJHdMWs5NiHqf58c9B2xnOVyC6e/SscVGmzx/03ZGe7MF7JKyTl2ebgReUAIjskS\nAg+VtnDq0CElxk/+b4xQlSzy+QrPbhLN2dUvzgsVhEGzIeU0ocD5xUdQqtSAzRM=\n=vQ0Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree c922d83d42769ca787d651f81e90cbe0eeea2bee\nparent bdaa65aead6053ff707b1c20320e213d29d4bb55\nauthor rickystewart <rstewart@mozilla.com> 1598385107 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1598385107 -0500\n\nIn case we fail to read the compressed content from the cache, treat the failure as a forced recache. This prevents us from failing build jobs unconditionally if cache entries are corrupt (or in case of other sporadic failures), in which case we should continue on with force-recompiling and recaching. (#836)\n\n"
